1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,933
Your night lasts eight hours.

2
00:00:01,983 --> 00:00:03,033
On Uranus?

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,800
Forty-two years.

4
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:05,928
The whole planet

5
00:00:05,928 --> 00:00:07,000
is lying

6
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,333
on its SIDE.

7
00:00:08,377 --> 00:00:10,067
So as it rolls around the Sun,

8
00:00:10,095 --> 00:00:11,300
your pole turns away

9
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:12,875
for half the trip.

10
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:14,271
One trip takes

11
00:00:14,271 --> 00:00:16,533
eighty-four years.

12
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:17,767
Half of that...

13
00:00:17,812 --> 00:00:19,267
in the DARK.

14
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:20,145
It's been night there

15
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:21,700
since two thousand seven...

16
00:00:21,748 --> 00:00:23,020
and sunrise?

17
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,633
Twenty forty-nine.

18
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,770
Morning...

19
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:27,633
Grandpa.

